---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Roof Leaks Wake Forest NC | Emergency Leak Repair" description="Roof leaking in Wake Forest? Fast diagnosis and permanent repair. Emergency tarping available 24/7. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Roof Leaks</div>
      <h1>Roof Leaks</h1>
      <p>Active water entry requires quick action to protect ceilings, insulation, and belongings.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Ceiling stains, dripping water, or wet insulation almost always start at the roof. We locate the true source — often flashing, a failed boot, or a damaged valley — and repair it properly. Emergency tarping is available when weather or damage requires immediate protection.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
